{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017Brsni7juYnZptX12txqMF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experimental results for ALL planned experiments in the experiment_plan, based on the \"median\" tier definition provided. I need to give specific predicted results with rationales for each experiment.\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and generate median-tier predictions based on the key metrics ranges and narrative guidance provided.\n\nLet me carefully review the median tier definition:\n\n- GRPO effective but RASP vs Standard recovery gap limited (<8pp)\n- CKA correlation moderately significant\n- Need to pivot to α optimization and pruning-recovery interaction as core contribution\n- Key metrics ranges provided\n\n\n- The narrative centers on how pruning and recovery interact, so I'll frame results around that dynamic\n\nNow I'm working through the planned experiments—full GSM8K evaluations, GRASPrune baseline, multi-seed runs, ablations on scoring, CKA analysis, SFT-only comparisons, and sparsity probes at 25% and 30%—and generating plausible median-tier results that support the pruning-recovery interaction story while keeping performance gaps realistic. OD eval (MATH-500, HumanEval, MMLU) with plans ranging from Bonsai baseline through SFT OOD eval, some already completed. I'm working through detailed predictions for each planned experiment, establishing metric ranges across postprune and post-training scenarios. Now I'm compiling the expected value ranges for GRPO recovery metrics, CKA statistical measures, and interaction effects between different training approaches.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13171,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13171},"output_token